  "risk_rating": "high",
  "short_description": "EG Secure Solutions SiteGuard Server Edition, a host-based WAF integrated into Apache httpd, Nginx and IIS, contains an OS command injection in its statistics feature (CVE-2026-106931). On installations with statistics enabled (the default), it runs with root or SYSTEM privileges, so an attacker with a limited foothold on the host can escalate to arbitrary root/SYSTEM command execution. Exploitation in the wild is confirmed.",
